From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: allolive <160342668+allolive@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 13 Sep 2026 11:05:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] VideoDatabase: read the stream details of a list in one query

Add GetStreamDetailsForFiles, which fetches the stream details of many file
ids in a single query, and use it from VideoThumbLoader in batches of 500.
The rows are interpreted through the same helper the single-file path uses.

Signed-off-by: allolive <160342668+allolive@users.noreply.github.com>

